+# after the enemy's next move (in range now + one move away, summed) by
+# MARGINAL_OC_HOLD_MARGIN, and it has a trip of at most MARGINAL_OC_MAX_TURNS
+# turns, not a lost race, that arrives before the game ends, to an objective
+# we do not control that still needs OC. Pass 2 then sends it like any other
+# unit. Every holder used to stay "under threat" whatever the margin, so
+# Custodian Guard Beta stood on a centre held 20 vs 9 while the enemy-held
